    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ToV</strong>\u00a0is a slow real-time / turn-based hybrid game, where turns (called\u00a0<i>ticks</i>) end automatically. A typical game (called a\u00a0<i>campaign</i>) takes a week or longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATWAR</strong>\u00a0(<i>Advance Tick When All Ready</i>) mode allows to advance ticks faster, making possible to play the whole campaign in one evening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule-based diplomacy</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense pacts with defensive wars auto-join</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alliances with shared scan range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inter-bloc diplomacy (joins, expulsions, war declarations, peace proposals) resolved by vote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suzerainties with tributes and, well... vassals!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign event notifications</strong>\u00a0are sent to your mobile device (currently Android only), so you don\u2019t need to check the game constantly or keep it running in the background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No cheating</strong>\u00a0\u2013 each client receives only the information it\u2019s allowed to see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-participation info</strong>\u00a0shows which players in your campaign have played (or are playing) other campaigns together \u2013 helps detect multi-boxers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local tick control</strong>\u00a0lets you review past ticks and preview future (predicted) ones \u2013 useful for analysis and planning.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ToV</strong>\u00a0is a slow real-time / turn-based hybrid game, where turns (called\u00a0<i>ticks</i>) end automatically. A typical game (called a\u00a0<i>campaign</i>) takes a week or longer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATWAR</strong>\u00a0(<i>Advance Tick When All Ready</i>) mode allows to advance ticks faster, making possible to play the whole campaign in one evening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rule-based diplomacy</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense pacts with defensive wars auto-join</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alliances with shared scan range</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inter-bloc diplomacy (joins, expulsions, war declarations, peace proposals) resolved by vote</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suzerainties with tributes and, well... vassals!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign event notifications</strong>\u00a0are sent to your mobile device (currently Android only), so you don\u2019t need to check the game constantly or keep it running in the background.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No cheating</strong>\u00a0\u2013 each client receives only the information it\u2019s allowed to see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-participation info</strong>\u00a0shows which players in your campaign have played (or are playing) other campaigns together \u2013 helps detect multi-boxers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local tick control</strong>\u00a0lets you review past ticks and preview future (predicted) ones \u2013 useful for analysis and planning.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Tears of Viceroy is a multiplayer strategy game of interstellar conquest, diplomacy and resource control. Form alliances, forge suzerainties, and outmaneuver rivals in a week-long battle of wits and ambition. For the homeworld!",
